    "integration": {
        "postgis_query_template": "SELECT l.*, d.danger_level FROM locations l JOIN districts d ON ST_Within(l.geom, d.geom) WHERE ST_DWithin(l.geom, ST_MakePoint({lon}, {lat})::geography, {radius_m})",
        "spawn_npc_pseudocode": "1. Query PostGIS for nearby locations\n2. For each location, get archetype from location_type_to_archetype\n3. Generate deterministic name from hash(location_id + tick)\n4. Apply district personality modifiers\n5. Return NPC with filled dialogue templates\n6. Cache NPC for subsequent queries at same tick",
        "behavior_execution": "1. Decode base64 Python from behavior\n2. Execute in sandbox with world codec context\n3. Return outputs for dialogue generation\n4. Log execution for deterministic replay"
